}


### 3. Inventory business failure: not enough stock
### Expected flow:
### POST /orders :
###    OrderCreated -> InventoryReservationFailed  -> order status: CANCELLED
POST {{orderBaseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
  "checkoutId": "20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
  "customerId": "30000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
  "paymentMethodId": "11111111-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
  "currency": "DKK",
  "totalAmount": 450.00,
  "items": [
    {
      "skuId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
      "productName": "Demo Product Low Stock",
      "quantity": 10,
      "unitPrice": 20.00,
      "itemTotalPrice": 200.00
    },
    {
      "skuId": "11111111-1111-1111-2222-111111111111",
      "productName": "Demo Product Low Stock",
      "quantity": 5,
      "unitPrice": 50.00,
      "itemTotalPrice": 250.00
    }
  ]
}


