### 5. Payment business failure and compensation
### Payment method starts with 22222222.
### Expected final flow:
### OrderCreated -> InventoryReserved -> PaymentRequested -> PaymentFailed
### -> InventoryReleaseRequested -> InventoryReleased
### Expected final order status: CANCELLED
### Expected inventory reservation status: RELEASED
POST {{orderBaseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004",
  "checkoutId": "20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004",
  "customerId": "30000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004",
  "paymentMethodId": "22222222-0000-0000-0000-000000000004",
  "currency": "DKK",
  "totalAmount": 25.00,
  "items": [
    {
      "skuId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
      "productName": "Demo Product A",
      "quantity": 1,
      "unitPrice": 25.00,
      "itemTotalPrice": 25.00
    }
  ]
}


### 6. Payment business failure because amount exceeds test authorization limit
### Expected final flow:
### OrderCreated -> InventoryReserved -> PaymentRequested -> PaymentFailed
### -> InventoryReleaseRequested -> InventoryReleased
### Expected final order status: CANCELLED
POST {{orderBaseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000005",
  "checkoutId": "20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000005",
  "customerId": "30000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000005",
  "paymentMethodId": "11111111-0000-0000-0000-000000000005",
  "currency": "DKK",
  "totalAmount": 1200.00,
  "items": [
    {
      "skuId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
      "productName": "Demo Product A",
      "quantity": 1,
      "unitPrice": 1200.00,
      "itemTotalPrice": 1200.00
    }
  ]
}


### 7. Payment technical failure
### Payment method starts with 33333333.
### Expected flow:
### OrderCreated -> InventoryReserved -> PaymentRequested
### payment-service throws technical failure, transaction rolls back, retries, then DLT.
### Expected order status remains PAYMENT_PENDING.
### Expected inventory reservation remains RESERVED.
POST {{orderBaseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000006",
  "checkoutId": "20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000006",
  "customerId": "30000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000006",
  "paymentMethodId": "33333333-0000-0000-0000-000000000006",
  "currency": "DKK",
  "totalAmount": 25.00,
  "items": [
    {
      "skuId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
      "productName": "Demo Product A",
      "quantity": 1,
      "unitPrice": 25.00,
      "itemTotalPrice": 25.00
    }
  ]
}


### 8. Checkout snapshot validation failure: item total does not match quantity * unit price
### Expected:
### Request rejected by order-service.
### If ApiExceptionHandler exists: HTTP 400.
### Otherwise Spring may return HTTP 500 depending on current exception handling.
### Expected side effect:
### No order and no outbox event.
POST {{orderBaseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000007",
  "checkoutId": "20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000007",
  "customerId": "30000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000007",
  "paymentMethodId": "11111111-0000-0000-0000-000000000007",
  "currency": "DKK",
  "totalAmount": 25.00,
  "items": [
    {
      "skuId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
      "productName": "Demo Product A",
      "quantity": 2,
      "unitPrice": 25.00,
      "itemTotalPrice": 25.00
    }
  ]
}


